* Ido: {{t+|io|soklo}}
{{trans-mid}}
* Russian: {{t|ru|пъедестал|m|sc=Cyrl}}, {{t+|ru|цоколь|m|sc=Cyrl}}
* Swedish: {{t+|sv|sockel|c}}
{{trans-bottom}}

